5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,Hello everyone. I am worried about who will actually stand in the room. Let us check the volunteer roster.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,Delivery is where we always fail. I want to see the lender paperwork against shipping cut-offs to find the real bottlenecks.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,I am curious about what visitors actually remember. Let us look at the five years of visitor comment slips.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"The floor must hold the weight of the building, not just the art. I will check the structural survey of the suspended bay.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I bet the money vanishes into the walls! I will check the loan transport costs over three seasons to find the sneaky leaks.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Shion, those cut-offs are vital. I will also look at the conservation lab staffing to see who is truly available.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Shizue, staffing is secondary. If the crates never arrive, the lab is just an empty room. I will check the maintenance log for powered displays.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@Shion, I hear you, but the crates are only half the story. I will also check the weekend head counts to see who actually shows up.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Shion, the powered displays strain the bay. I will also check the evening hire bookings to see if the room is already spoken for.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Shion, if the crates are late, the invoices are definitely late too! I will also check the mount-making charges to see where the joiner's rate hides.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"@May, the head counts tell us who visits, but the roster tells us who stays. I am glad you are looking at both.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@May, numbers are cold comfort if the objects never arrive. I will stick to the maintenance log to see what actually breaks.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,"@Shion, cold numbers are still numbers. I want to know if the crowd actually returns, not just if the boxes arrive.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@May, the crowd matters, but the floor matters more. If the bay sags, no one stays. I will stick to the structural survey.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Misaki, a sagging floor is scary, but a sagging budget is worse! I am sticking to the mount-making charges to catch those sneaky costs.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
