60,3,1,talk,Shizue,,I am thinking of the one conservator. Candidate B puts a working bench right in the room. That feels like a heavy ask for our small team.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Shion,,"@Shizue, B is a trap. A visible bench means constant intervention. My data shows powered displays fail. I want zero moving parts.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,May,,"@Shion, I hear you, but my comment slips say people return for the human touch, not the hardware. Candidate A has live demonstrations.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"Candidate C is a no-go. Overhead rigging strains the bay, and the weight limit is absolute. I will not risk the floor for light.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Sakura,,"@Shion, I agree! C is a money pit. But @May, A is perfect! Local means no transport fees, and the craftspeople bring their own tools. No sneaky invoices!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@May, the human touch is precious. But with one conservator, live demonstrations mean constant handling. I worry about the wear on the pieces.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Shion,,"@May, human touch is a liability. My data proves powered displays fail. Candidate A is static and local. It avoids the shipping cut-offs that killed us before.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,May,,"@Shion, you are missing the point. The ""human touch"" is the craftspeople, not the machines. A is alive, B is a lab, and C is a structural nightmare.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, A is light and local. It respects the bay limit and the hire schedule. The floor can hold it without shoring.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Sakura,,"@May, you are right! A is alive and local. No transport fees, no joiner bills. It is the budget-friendly choice!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Sakura, I am glad the budget is safe. But the craftspeople are volunteers. With our small team, can we truly support their demonstrations without burning them out?","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Shion,,"@Shizue, the craftspeople are the risk, not the objects. If they miss a date, the room is empty. I need a schedule that does not depend on human reliability.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,May,,"@Shion, the crowd does not come for the schedule; they come for the person. If the craftspeople miss a date, we lose a day, not the season.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Shion, the floor is the only thing that cannot be rescheduled. A is light enough to respect the bay. I am ready to vote.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Shion, if the craftspeople miss a day, the room is still full of beautiful local weaves! No empty crates, no broken lights. I am ready to vote!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Shizue,,I am ready to vote. Candidate A feels the most gentle for our small team.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Shion,,"I vote for A. It is static, local, and avoids the shipping cut-offs that have plagued us. No powered displays, no broken promises.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,May,,"I vote for A. The comment slips are clear: people return for the living presence, not the static case. It is the only choice that honors the record.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Misaki,,I vote for A. It respects the bay limit and the hire schedule. The floor can hold it without shoring.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Sakura,,"I vote for A! No transport fees, no joiner bills, and the weaves are right here. It is the smart, budget-friendly choice!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
